      "message": "fix(app): built-in shrink-fit chucks in the component library\n\nThe merge of main brought the component library (#4233), whose holder\nconversion matched only Er and Weldon. Clamp::Shrink gave E0004.\n\nA shrink-fit chuck now maps to an adaptive item with its taper as the\nmachine side and a plain bore CYL <bore> as the workpiece side (no\ncollet). Its geometry is the holder library's own outline at the\nlibrary gauge length. Pinned by builtin_shrink in tool_library_holders.\n\nRefs #3919\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
